s://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-13T08:12:19Z","updated_at":"2025-10-13T08:12:19Z","body":"> The only reservation I have is introducing new programming paradigms into 3.x which will probably not be widely adopted, since it's not as actively developed as 4.x.\r\n\r\nI'm planning on converting many existing APIs (especially geometry) which I've wanted to change since years before `Span` was introduced, because they currently introduce copying inefficiencies.\r\n\r\nI think there will be a lot of suitable cases to use `Span` instead of fixed containers. The problem is actually even worse in 3.x than 4.x because we have `PoolVector` in addition to `LocalVector` and `Vector`, any of which can cause copying through implicit conversion.\r\n\r\nThe only areas to be particularly careful of are things that currently take advantage of COW, such as `VisualServer`, where `Vector` with COW makes sense for the server API because client / server may be out of sync, and COW minimizes copying. There are also functions that may be cheaper using COW.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3396349990/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]